  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  _englishVersion: Allow game mechanics to use short recordings of your voice. This includes SCP-939's "With Many Voices" ability, which can record and play back short voice samples of killed players. All recordings are discarded the moment you leave the server, or once the round restarts.
